        477.6181640625,
        110.63681030273438
      ],
      "text": "Should LC-aNAATs on respiratory samples be used to diagnose rifampicin",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        110.94883728027344,
        509.9906311035156,
        125.03683471679688
      ],
      "text": "resistance in adults and adolescents with signs and symptoms or who screened",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        125.34880065917969,
        311.3953552246094,
        139.43679809570312
      ],
      "text": "positive for pulmonary TB, against an MRS?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        150.10382080078125,
        526.6891479492188,
        163.2488250732422
      ],
      "text": "Of the 13 studies (2553 participants) that evaluated sputum specimens, sensitivity for detecting",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.962686538696289,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        165.60382080078125,
        526.960205078125,
        178.7488250732422
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin resistance was not estimable for two studies ( ). The sensitivities in the  Fig. 2.1.2",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.10382080078125,
        527.1788940429688,
        194.2488250732422
      ],
      "text": "remaining 11 studies (2540 participants) included in the meta-analysis were between 53%",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        196.60382080078125,
        526.9623413085938,
        209.7488250732422
      ],
      "text": "and 100%, and the specificities were between 97% and 100%. The summary sensitivity was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        212.10382080078125,
        526.9647216796875,
        225.2488250732422
      ],
      "text": "95.1% (95% CI: 83.1–98.7), and the summary specificity was 98.1% (95% CI: 97.0–98.7). Only",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.60382080078125,
        527.0424194335938,
        240.7488250732422
      ],
      "text": "two of the 11 included studies assessed Truenat MTB-RIF Dx; one of them, a study from a single",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.97562313079834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        243.10382080078125,
        526.9644165039062,
        256.24884033203125
      ],
      "text": "country, had a sensitivity outside of confidence interval limits (53%). Nevertheless, overall, the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        258.60382080078125,
        444.2764892578125,
        271.74884033203125
      ],
      "text": "certainty of evidence for both sensitivity and specificity was considered high.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
