        70.86609649658203,
        527.0210571289062,
        451.9621276855469,
        537.7760009765625
      ],
      "text": "amplification test; MRS: microbiological reference standard; TN: true negative; TP: true positive.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        540.639892578125,
        230.8838653564453,
        551.4107055664062
      ],
      "text": "a  Studies are sorted by assay and author.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        569.9265747070312,
        245.04849243164062,
        586.3065795898438
      ],
      "text": "Detection of TB meningitis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        597.541259765625,
        522.2305297851562,
        611.6292114257812
      ],
      "text": "Should LC-aNAATs on cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) be used to diagnose TB meningitis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.941162109375,
        451.48699951171875,
        626.0291137695312
      ],
      "text": "in adults with signs and symptoms of TB meningitis, against an MRS?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        636.6961059570312,
        526.7639770507812,
        649.8411254882812
      ],
      "text": "LC-aNAAT summary sensitivity and specificity were 88.2% (95% CI: 83.7–91.6) and 96.0% (95%",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.962486267089844,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        652.1961059570312,
        527.185791015625,
        665.3411254882812
      ],
      "text": "CI: 86.8–98.9), respectively, based on 16 Xpert Ultra studies (1684 participants); the certainty of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.972867012023926,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        667.6961059570312,
        526.9661254882812,
        680.8411254882812
      ],
      "text": "evidence was high for sensitivity and moderate for specificity ( ). Only data on Xpert  Fig. 2.1.3",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.1961059570312,
        527.0776977539062,
        696.3411254882812
      ],
      "text": "Ultra were included in the evaluation to answer this population, intervention, comparator and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.991096496582031,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        698.6961059570312,
        527.0288696289062,
        711.8411254882812
      ],
      "text": "outcome (PICO) question. Of note, trace results from Xpert Ultra were considered positive and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.996149063110352,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        714.1961059570312,
        527.0814208984375,
        727.3411254882812
      ],
      "text": "formed a significant proportion of positive results (16–63%). Data on Truenat were limited and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.975221633911133,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        729.6961059570312,
        438.4476013183594,
        742.8411254882812
      ],
      "text": "variable and thus were not included. For more details, see  . Web Annex B.3",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
